  "why": "The goal is a definitional modular equivalence n + a \u2261 a [ZMOD n] that should close by unfolding the ModEq definition and applying reflexivity or basic equivalence combinators, since adding the modulus to any value is definitionally congruent to that value modulo the modulus."
